# Local reference copies of AddmusicK 1.0.11's sources and readme. The compiler
# cites them by line number; fetch them from an AddmusicK release.
AddmusicKsrc/
AddmusicKreadme/

# Claude Code. Machine-local permissions and installed skills stay out; the
# CLAUDE.md guidance files are checked in so a fresh clone gets them.
**/.claude/*
!**/.claude/CLAUDE.md
